    "body": "I think I would prefer disabling this by default and gating it with a `use_heuristics`-option since `nix shell` not being detectable (as opposed to `nix develop`) seems to be an intentional upstream choice.\r\n\r\nPlease also document that there is now a third unknown nix-shell state. (Having the message for the unknown state be configurable might be good too, but I think we could wait for someone to make a feature request first.)",
